Requirement: Master every Mundane Technique and critically succeed with a Primary Skill in combat.

Unlock: Gain the Style's Affinity Attribute and second Style Shido. This is the character's second and final Martial Affinity Attribute and must obey the Wuxia Affinity Pair Rule: the inherited Mundane Martial Art Affinity is ST or HT, the two Affinities must differ, DX + IQ is prohibited, and ST + HT is legal. Connoisseur (Martial Arts) may identify the exact nature of a supernatural martial-art ability.
